    intro: "Whether you found us searching for mehndi pagri tying for a standout groom look or were referred by a planner, the process is the same: confirm the essentials, and we bring the right team.",
    section1Title: "What this covers",
    section1Body: "This service covers the groom's dedicated pagdi session, coordinated family pagdis and faster baraati safa tying, all planned around one preparation room. Fabric, fold and finishing are agreed before the team travels, so nothing is decided on the spot.",
    section2Title: "How to book",
    section2Body: "A confirmed booking includes the agreed fabric, colour and total quantity, so nothing is left to decide on the wedding day itself — changes become harder to accommodate once the team has travelled.",
    section3Title: "Who usually books this",
